WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Okay,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.267
a number series!

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:10.933
Sixty,

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:11.600
fifty-four,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.267
forty-eight,

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:12.933
forty-two,

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.267
and then...

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:16.267
what comes next?

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:16.933
A.

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:17.600
Thirty-six,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.267
B.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:18.933
Thirty-eight,

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:19.600
C.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.267
Thirty-four,

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:21.600
or D.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.267
Thirty?

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:23.600
Five seconds!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.600
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.033
The answer is...

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.633
A,

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:34.233
thirty-six!

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.767
Each number goes down by six:

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.367
sixty,

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:38.933
fifty-four,

00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:39.533
forty-eight,

00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:40.133
forty-two,

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:43.667
so forty-two minus six is thirty-six.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.700
Check this out,

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.567
a word analogy!

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:51.067
Puppy is to dog,

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:53.567
as kitten is to...

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:54.200
what?

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:54.833
A.

00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:55.467
Pet,

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.067
B.

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:56.700
Paw,

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.333
C.

00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:57.967
Cub,

00:00:57.967 --> 00:00:59.200
or D.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:00:59.833
Cat?

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.067
Five seconds!

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:08.067
TIME'S UP!

00:01:08.733 --> 00:01:09.100
It's...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:09.433
D,

00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:09.800
cat!

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.933
A puppy grows up to be

00:01:11.933 --> 00:01:12.633
a dog,

00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:14.767
so a kitten grows up to

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:15.833
be a cat.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:17.600
It is the adult animal.

00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:20.400
Check this out,

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.600
fill in the blank!

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:25.333
The rain poured all day,

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:28.600
so the school had to blank

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.900
the outdoor games until the next

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.433
weekend.

00:01:32.433 --> 00:01:32.967
A.

00:01:32.967 --> 00:01:33.533
Enjoy,

00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:34.067
B.

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:34.633
Paint,

00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:35.167
C.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:35.700
Count,

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:36.800
or D.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:37.367
Postpone?

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:38.433
Five seconds!

00:01:44.233 --> 00:01:45.433
TIME'S UP!

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:46.533
It's...

00:01:46.533 --> 00:01:46.933
D,

00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:47.367
postpone!

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:49.067
Rain stops outdoor games,

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:51.600
so they had to move them

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.433
to later.

00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:54.533
Postpone means to put something

00:01:54.533 --> 00:01:56.667
off until a later time.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.200
So,

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.233
are you smart or fart?

00:02:00.233 --> 00:02:02.667
Count up your correct answers to

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:03.867
find your rank!

00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:05.367
So,

00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:06.767
how did you do?

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:08.133
Comment your score below,

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:09.500
and follow for more!
